   "description": "The Next Chapter The Lozier is Cornell’s take on a classic three-hand watch meant for everyday wear. It draws inspiration from some of our favorite vintage watches, updated with contemporary typography and manufacturing techniques, while staying true to our core values. This includes sourcing high quality materials, investing in domestic manufacturing, and working with the best partners we can find, many across the United States. A Study in Subtlety The Lozier starts with a three-piece case measuring 37.4mm across and just 8.5mm thick, including the sapphire crystal. This is complemented by the three-tier German silver dial, with a grained finish and diamond-cut edges, as well as our signature Chicago Roman numerals marking the hours. The Cornell Leaf hands are also unique to the Lozier, offering our take on a watchmaking classic, also crafted in German silver and finished by hand with brushed tops and diamond-cut edges. Powering the watch is a Sellita SW-300-1 b movement, offering reliable performance and easy servicing over the long-haul. It is housed behind a solid stainless steel caseback, perfect for a personal engraving. Availability 2025 production Sold Out . Order books open in 2026.",
